    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0220_rival_01",
      "hash64": "F8853C08C42AC544",
      "text": "这里就是桌台市，\\n帕底亚地区最大的城市！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0220_rival_02",
      "hash64": "F8853F08C42ACA5D",
      "text": "这儿的贸易一直都很兴隆。\\n为了获取新的技术和知识，\\r\\n很多人都会往这里来呢。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0220_rival_03",
      "hash64": "F8853E08C42AC8AA",
      "text": "有能打理发型的美容院，\\n还有熟菜很好吃的店！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
